1
00:00:00,460 --> 00:00:05,884
The real value of assessment is not the score. It is what the teacher
can do next.

2
00:00:06,964 --> 00:00:14,788
Snap and Mark brings one private paper capture page into review, without
sending roster identity or an answer key to recognition.

3
00:00:15,868 --> 00:00:22,348
The transcription remains a proposal until the teacher corrects
uncertainty and explicitly approves the record.

4
00:00:23,428 --> 00:00:30,964
EdulabsAI helps surface repeated patterns, but the teacher verifies the
misconception before any reteach is created.

5
00:00:32,044 --> 00:00:38,428
Build editable learning groups, a mini explanation and focused practice
inside a ready Tomorrow Pack.

6
00:00:39,508 --> 00:00:46,468
Use new independent evidence to resolve the pattern, then draft a
consent-first Family Digest for teacher approval.

7
00:00:47,548 --> 00:00:54,748
Human review remains at every consequential point: paper transcription,
group action and family communication.

8
00:00:55,828 --> 00:01:02,212
Turn evidence into tomorrow's move. Explore EdulabsAI at edulabsai dot
com.

